                <l xml:id="m-b53ba7d2-b3d0-4888-89e1-d4d5ab2106bd" facs="#m-db843c9f-34d2-4a1c-8c1e-f98837a0df47" label="ambiguous">789</l><l xml:id="m-bd1dd76d-7a94-4555-931f-82bfca3cc9e8" facs="#m-13e550d0-ea6d-49b0-b697-84af94b6e43d" label="ambiguous">Easter Tuesday.</l><l xml:id="m-09a5d14e-f34c-4ef5-bbf8-fede173e603b" facs="#m-21394a26-737e-405c-9e50-298df62f35a5" label="ambiguous">EASTER TUESDAY.</l><l xml:id="m-55c8dd20-ee46-445b-80e1-1eccfd23858c" facs="#m-9ac4cd5a-d903-4b95-a8cf-6485822fa2de" label="text-like">AT MASS.</l><l xml:id="m-de741a12-7368-4fbe-83da-e1b420604681" facs="#m-407ab257-98eb-492f-aff4-91a0a4727eab" label="ambiguous">Intr.</l><l xml:id="m-51bb6050-d86c-4cb9-a3ab-a9ade4bd2051" facs="#m-5e97669a-36d6-4dad-898a-a64ade7b6808" label="ambiguous">7.</l><l xml:id="m-c75e3317-b955-434d-9bb4-730844b6e744" facs="#m-bbd610ac-d05a-4f80-83b0-78b0e4310664" label="lyrics-like">-qua“ sa-pi- énti- ae potávit é- os, al-le¬</l><l xml:id="m-c03a90a8-1020-4324-923b-0b3d8a9012d8" facs="#m-d921ca44-15de-41a1-9223-1a9f2c0e3226" label="lyrics-like">lú- ia : firmá- bi-tur in sl- lis. et non flecté- tur. al¬</l><l xml:id="m-d4228a5a-89d0-4137-aa24-82da7ad21f8b" facs="#m-b370f464-ad99-4b47-82f0-d0be124b5ec8" label="lyrics-like">le- lú-ia:</l><l xml:id="m-b7d02dbd-7aca-4b69-b2c4-c3a737163657" facs="#m-129aa3ba-059b-4fa9-bd00-839d3531b961" label="lyrics-like">et ex-altábit é¬ os in aetérnum,</l><l xml:id="m-b00ac309-eb97-48fd-8d9e-21bac1a3a1d8" facs="#m-72072700-94eb-42f6-aaf1-6361ce4d9ee5" label="ambiguous">al¬</l><l xml:id="m-a3a7bed8-0be3-4712-9d76-c7025c18c924" facs="#m-d297f4cd-e4a7-4e00-944e-ab93466383a7" label="lyrics-like">lú- ia. Ps. Con-fi-témi-ni Dómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-6acf2037-e3bf-42d0-b206-4fd64e126f0b" facs="#m-9706273f-747b-4f2e-a922-d53235958ebf" label="lyrics-like">le- lú¬ ia, al-le¬</l><l xml:id="m-5109f1f3-8e79-41ad-ae6b-b1a3487dabd4" facs="#m-1c4f44ba-72ee-4ee8-8ddf-e7a7abb566ca" label="lyrics-like">no, et invocá-te nómen é-jus:* annunti-â-te inter gén¬</l><l xml:id="m-c1573a24-2bae-4b7b-84f7-a15a3d1d3ed6" facs="#m-54b514cf-bb14-49e3-8620-18a0c5602867" label="lyrics-like">tes ó-pe-ra é¬ jus. Gló- ri-a Pátri. Eu o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-870e1c7a-b053-4c0c-bb3c-7be2fe59138c" facs="#m-e5a47b85-46af-48c8-95d8-2ef6d43607cb" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-bed584ec-9580-415e-bf3b-5395ca9faded" facs="#m-12f2d02e-4a2b-425d-a3eb-4ca617cf5b86" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui Ecclésiam tuam novo! tum vivéndo téneant, * quod fide</l><l xml:id="m-1cd8c2c4-969a-46c2-8351-ff99d6fc277a" facs="#m-8582d84b-1666-457f-90e9-19a9fdff3b9b" label="lyrics-like">percepérunt. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-863bc64c-e265-4dc7-8e5d-d6996b29d59d" facs="#m-a4993f5d-a9ad-424d-ace9-d141cf003c2c" label="lyrics-like">I semper foetu multíplicas:</l><l xml:id="m-ccf5a19d-fd10-4618-98c9-39a6a2064811" facs="#m-6dffabde-d623-4d8e-a3e5-8547181afde5" label="lyrics-like">concéde fámulis tuis, ut sacramén¬</l><l xml:id="m-2b20bc08-8d0f-49af-b2b9-12d91f096e79" facs="#m-c4a870ff-4276-422b-bb73-3630fc690cd3" label="ambiguous">Lectio Actuum Apostolorum. Act. 13. d.</l><l xml:id="m-9f70b048-7ab4-447f-b40e-c9427dd67eb7" facs="#m-4bd9da7f-cfb1-4ce0-89a5-38a64019f8c0" label="lyrics-like">TN diébus illis: Súrgens Paulus, et tis inveniéntes in eo, petiérunt a</l><l xml:id="m-90f83d60-599d-4ada-8564-0d93016cd718" facs="#m-a97ba85d-f6b1-446f-8a26-f024d66f2bf3" label="lyrics-like">Piláto, ut interficerent eum. Cum¬</l><l xml:id="m-409f1c7e-4532-4b55-85a3-95ba6bb58f8d" facs="#m-faea4ce7-f948-409a-92bd-cd6fee07101e" label="lyrics-like">L manu siléntium indícens, ait:</l><l xml:id="m-3c23b476-f60b-4436-b9fd-2ad7bbfd9b1f" facs="#m-da3bfd2e-8d9d-4efa-85e8-0b7452d2f6cd" label="lyrics-like">Viri fratres, filii géneris Abraham,</l><l xml:id="m-8a9d8fde-1563-44b3-b62e-c6244b1585a3" facs="#m-32ef6b9f-c7e8-402b-a8aa-44e42adb3ba7" label="lyrics-like">que consummássent ómnia quae de</l><l xml:id="m-b9ed0e05-874a-4480-9c4a-851f56d3aaee" facs="#m-3823187c-62fc-4a02-aa4c-e28065c101cb" label="lyrics-like">eo scripta erant, deponéntes eum</l><l xml:id="m-4bd3cbe9-6067-4a6a-a657-c5df392d1c57" facs="#m-53cfe258-44ed-4a48-81dd-9c77c2545056" label="ambiguous">et qui in vobis timent Deum, vobis</l><l xml:id="m-13d18ddc-1a81-460c-ba11-8845b7c43e48" facs="#m-329c8739-3fff-4527-8ee3-5dc073d32fa0" label="lyrics-like">verbum salútis hujus missum est.</l><l xml:id="m-78ac8839-afa1-4f68-ab05-5154de42681a" facs="#m-d7585949-b935-4e7d-9a68-a78a002f0485" label="lyrics-like">de ligno, posuérunt eum in monu¬</l><l xml:id="m-d9a2ebab-51ca-46f7-acb7-46c3887fd333" facs="#m-cf574d9a-31f0-4208-a6c6-95c1f9f61aa0" label="lyrics-like">Qui enim habitábant Jerúsalem, et</l><l xml:id="m-7c99f890-f6ff-43eb-9b24-619f0ed03f43" facs="#m-a514414f-e2b7-48bc-8ea8-920d84c7a2d1" label="lyrics-like">ménto. Deus vero suscitávit eum a</l><l xml:id="m-eb1ffe80-68e7-4359-a764-22b726f8aca6" facs="#m-5f889d78-8c20-42c1-ad34-8ef6b6930fa4" label="lyrics-like">principes ejus, ignorántes Jesum et</l><l xml:id="m-0698cc5a-3f84-4ee7-a0c6-e422f67d9a7a" facs="#m-b0960433-d90a-4b23-b676-4309a1cb333c" label="lyrics-like">mórtuis tértia die: qui visus est per</l><l xml:id="m-5f6362bf-e12f-47b1-8697-1a8c0b6afb99" facs="#m-8975b78f-5754-4de7-be44-1adb958870aa" label="lyrics-like">dies multos his, qui simul ascénde¬</l><l xml:id="m-9a5f3c70-68f0-45d2-8564-dc15b9aad4f7" facs="#m-829e0f11-6176-4c0e-9af2-424a36b8adf3" label="lyrics-like">voces Prophetárum, quae per omne</l><l xml:id="m-2f8d22cb-56ae-4de0-a60f-ee2c5649022b" facs="#m-d8987085-43f3-4e6c-9ea7-820bfc2a76cc" label="lyrics-like">sábbatum legúntur, judicàntes im¬</l><l xml:id="m-db0eadd0-efab-422c-88d0-ad5fa068ab3e" facs="#m-ec68f0fa-e51b-435c-87a9-6b3d3d017967" label="lyrics-like">rant cum eo de Galilaéa in Jerúsa¬</l><l xml:id="m-9b84b9f2-91ed-4da4-b939-6c07b73997dc" facs="#m-fa0e6d31-2991-4e53-8a20-816e9eb97184" label="lyrics-like">plevérunt: et nullam causam mór- lem: qui usque nunc sunt testes</l></lg>
            </div>
